eal-time memory, CPU, battery status (auto-refresh) |\n| 📋 **Info** | Device model, Android v"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"ersion, serial number, etc. |\n| 📦 **Apps** | Browse, search, view app details (version, permissions)"},{"id":"p13s4","text":" |\n| 📝 **Logs** | Real-time logcat output with V/D/I/W/E level filtering |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### 🔌 Device Connection"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- **WiFi Connect** - Connect to Android device via IP address\n- **WiFi Pair** - Support pairing veri"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"fication for first-time connections\n- **Connection History** - Auto-save history for quick reconnect"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"\n- **Multi-device** - Manage multiple devices simultaneously"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### 🎮 Device Control"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- **Screen** - Screenshot, screen on/off, real-time monitoring\n- **Input** - Tap, swipe, text input,"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" key events\n- **Apps** - Install, uninstall, launch, force stop\n- **File** - Push/pull files"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### 📊 Performance Monitoring"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- **Memory** - Real-time RAM usage\n- **Battery** - Level, temperature, health status\n- **CPU** - Cor"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"-time RAM usage\n- **Battery** - Level, temperature, health status\n- **CPU** - Cores, processor model"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### 🔧 System Debug"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- **Logcat** - Real-time log output with level filtering\n- **Dumpsys** - Query system service info\n-"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" **Getprop** - Read system properties\n- **Shell** - Execute shell commands directly"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"> 💡 Copy any install command below and give it to Agent for automatic installation"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### Way 1: GitHub Install"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### Way 2: Local Install"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### Way 3: Natural Language Install"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Just tell Agent:\n>